#
#   incremental_read_loop_read_request - Fetch::Infrastructure::IncrementalReadLoopReadRequest:
#   the read request of a body's incrementally-read loop
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Infrastructure/IncrementalReadLoopReadRequest.cpp
#       (lines 15-85). Its chunk, close and error steps queue fetch tasks; the reader and a
#       chunk's Uint8Array are the stand-ins of DESIGN.md §3.6 (region p2s).
